    "code": "theorem mathd_algebra_320\n  (x : \u211d) (a b c : \u2115) (h\u2080 : 0 < a \u2227 0 < b \u2227 0 < c \u2227 0 < x)\n  (h\u2081 : 2 * x ^ 2 = 4 * x + 9) (h\u2082 : x = (a + Real.sqrt b) / c) (h\u2083 : \u00ac \u2203d:\u2115 , d ^ 2 \u2223 b) : a + b + c = 26 := by\n  have h\u2084 : \u2203 d : \u2115, d ^ 2 \u2223 b := by\n    use 1\n    have h\u2084\u2081 : (1 : \u2115) ^ 2 \u2223 b := by\n      -- Since b > 0, 1 \u2223 b is true\n      have h\u2084\u2082 : 0 < b := h\u2080.2.1\n      have h\u2084\u2083 : (1 : \u2115) \u2223 b := by\n        exact Nat.one_dvd b\n      simpa [Nat.pow_succ, Nat.mul_one] using h\u2084\u2083\n    exact h\u2084\u2081\n  \n  have h\u2085 : False := by\n    have h\u2085\u2081 : \u2203 d : \u2115, d ^ 2 \u2223 b := h\u2084\n    exact h\u2083 h\u2085\u2081\n  \n  have h\u2086 : a + b + c = 26 := by\n    exfalso\n    exact h\u2085\n  \n  exact h\u2086",
